<title>FRANCE: New York top origin for Paris air imports in June.</title>
<headline>New York top origin for Paris air imports in June.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Paris airports authority, the Aeroports de Paris (ADP), said New York was the top airport gateway for imports to Charles de Gaulle and Orly airports in June 1997.</p>
<p>The top ten airport gateways for ADP imports in June 1997, in tonnes, with percentage change on June 1996, were:</p>
<p>	 Origin	 June '97   Pct change</p>
<p>    1. New York     3,250	down 14.1</p>
<p>    2. Chicago	2,277	down 12.4</p>
<p>    3. Tokyo	  1,856	  up 23.5</p>
<p>    4. Hong Kong    1,651	  up 23.7</p>
<p>    5. Los Angeles  1,360	down 10.1</p>
<p>    6. Bangkok	1,186	  up 32.3</p>
<p>    7. Montreal     1,005	  up 18.1</p>
<p>    8. Singapore	599	  up 91.4</p>
<p>    9. Taipei	   519	  up 48.9</p>
<p>   10. Miami	    487	down 14.7</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
